    "body": "**Ready for review.** The contributor checked it on their Tormach 770MX job, in a build combining this PR with #162 and #240 (local only):\n- In the tool editor they set **Tool number = 31** on their end mill and posted. The program says `T31 M6` / `G43 H31` with no hand edit.\n- That posted file is **byte-for-byte identical** to the program they had already cut in material on the 770MX, which was then hand-edited from `T1`/`H1`. So this PR's output is proven on the machine.\n\nGate and pinning tests are as in the description. Note for whoever merges: this PR and #240 each add a `#[cfg(test)] mod …;` line at the same place in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs`. The second to merge needs a one-line keep-both resolution.",
